 Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9TDyIOrSrncpsAUxVqx3aA","review_id":"GFFs-TRgDSVI5Z97DimLNg","date":"2011-01-10T17:00:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9431267976760864,"text_excerpt":"Went here the other night with my work family. Really impressed with the place, EXCEPT that there was an LSU game on the tv and everyone was screaming at the top of their lungs. It was so loud I could hardly hear the conversations at my table. I hate football! Anyway, the place impressed me enough that I'll go back, next time NOT on a game night. I got the Steak Frites, very tasty and cooked exactly the way I like. The fries were thin and crispy. Our table ordered one of every appetizer on the menu (something I've always wanted to do at a restaurant, thanks boss!) and each app was really good, with the exception of the lettuce wraps--sounds fancy on the menu but comes to your table comple..."},{"business_id":"9TDyIOrSrncpsAUxVqx3aA","review_id":"QzSPTVTDna8oBIuqzZzzMA","date":"2013-01-24T19:05:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411643147468567,"text_excerpt":"This place is balls-to-the-walls amazing. The food is affordable but stunningly good: their truffle mac n cheese was the best mac n cheese I have EVER HAD. Bar none. And there was a ton of food, we could barely finish our meal (although we ordered the salted caramel cheesecake because, hey, salted caramel cheesecake). Our waitress was so sweet, friendly, and made wonderful suggestions. She also served me up one hell of a Bloody Mary (as well as a delicious pint of NOLA Hopitoulas). If you're in NOLA, I would highly recommend checking this place out."},{"business_id":"9TDyIOrSrncpsAUxVqx3aA","review_id":"H3WIJTKExvs7UHoyneMhyw","date":"2016-07-13T23:32:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375366568565369,"text_excerpt":"So, Capdeville wins for one of the greatest happy hours on a Friday in the city, hands down. I enjoy Capdeville for many reasons: the drinks are always great; the atmosphere is nice; they play good music; and, the food is pretty good. During football season, they had chicken wings which were absolutely delicious... they need to have those things year-round. I went recently and we had the Peach and Duck Wontons, truffle mac and cheese, and shrimp creole. The wontons were nothing to write home about; lacking a lot in taste, certainly didn't taste any peach, and just overall lackluster. The truffle mac, on the other hand, was so good... I'll definitely be ordering that again. The \"small\" is ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9TDyIOrSrncpsAUxVqx3aA","photo_id":"RfbzXmVKe_FchByqBtV3pw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/RfbzXmVKe_FchByqBtV3pw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8486946821212769},{"business_id":"9TDyIOrSrncpsAUxVqx3aA","photo_id":"PA56guZEgE3FNOPVhrormQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PA56guZEgE3FNOPVhror